     "titulo": "Habits and preferences",
     "texto": [
      "**Τρώω συνήθως…** means «I usually eat…». To express a preference, say **προτιμώ** («I prefer»).",
      "**Υγιεινό** means healthy and **ανθυγιεινό** unhealthy. **Περισσότερα λαχανικά** means more vegetables; **λιγότερη ζάχαρη**, less sugar. The form of the adjective agrees with the noun."
     ],
